{
    "title": "Preply: Learn Languages",
    "description": "<b>Are you ready to take your language learning one step further? With Preply, you can learn Spanish, English, German, Dutch, French, Russian, Italian and many other languages at your own pace in one-on-one video lessons with your private tutor.</b>\r\n\r\nIf you want to learn a foreign language or improve your pronunciation, this is the right place for you. Preply is a language learning app to find your expert language tutor. Now you can learn Spanish, English, Russian, German, Dutch, Thai, Arabic, Italian, Chinese, French and any other foreign language with native speakers and language experts. This app gives you access to personalized live lessons with your very own tutor, the vocabulary trainer and other learning materials.\r\n\r\n<b>Learn a new language: Find your tutor for one of 50+ languages, including</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 English \r\n\ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddf2\ud83c\uddfd Spanish\r\n\ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea German\r\n\ud83c\uddf3\ud83c\uddf1 Dutch\r\n\ud83c\uddee\ud83c\uddf9 Italian\r\n\ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7 French\r\n\ud83c\udde8\ud83c\uddf3 Chinese (Mandarin, Cantonese)\r\n\ud83c\uddef\ud83c\uddf5 Japanese\r\n\ud83c\uddf7\ud83c\uddfa Russian\r\n\ud83c\uddf9\ud83c\udded Thai\r\n\u2026 and many more!\r\n====================\r\n\u2605 20% discount on the first lesson: Book your first foreign language learning lesson via the app with the <b>code APP20</b>!\r\n====================\r\n<b>Learn a new language through private lessons</b>\r\n\r\n\u2605 Learning languages is easy and fun! More than 30.000 experienced language teachers are ready to practise with beginners (to learn a new language), intermediate and advanced learners. \r\n\r\n\u2605 Tutors for over 50 languages, including: German, English, French, Italian, Polish, Chinese (Mandarin, Cantonese), Arabic, and many more.\r\n\r\n\u2605 English course: Improve your skills with our vocabulary tool. With the vocabulary trainer, you can learn and consolidate vocabulary in the Preply English course.\r\n\r\n<b>With Preply, you can learn a foreign language wherever and whenever you want:</b>\r\n\r\n\u2605 Learn a new language at your pace and on your budget: English pronunciation training, Russian language or Chinese (Mandarin, Cantonese), English for kids, German spelling, improving the Mexican Spanish accent, or learn Spanish from scratch - whatever you want to improve!\r\n\r\n\u2605 With Preply, international experts help you to learn a new language. Because it's so easy to find the right tutor from any part of the world, you can start at any time. The perfect English course and the perfect app to expand your German, Dutch or French vocabulary, and much more.\r\n\r\n\u2605 To learn languages with our app is easy, especially when you learn with an expert tutor. To find your match, you can read student reviews, watch video presentations and view tutor profiles.\r\n\r\n\u2605 With this language learning app, you can talk to a tutor via the integrated chat before booking your first lesson!\r\n\r\n\u2605 Learn English vocabulary, learn to speak with an Mexican Spanish accent, improve your spelling in German, learn Spanish or start to learn Hindi or Thai - from anywhere via video call in the learning app itself or on the Preply website.\r\n\r\n\u2605 Discuss your goals with your tutor: whether you want to learn languages from scratch, improve your grammar, become fluent in Arabic, Dutch, Korean, French, Turkish, Thai, Hindi, Japanese, Russian language, Chinese, etc., or improve your English pronunciation. If you wish, you can switch to a new teacher at any time, whom you can get to know through a course or live lessons.\r\n\r\n\u2605 Preply is more than just a language learning app. You can supplement your lessons with interactive language games, materials and other activities, including popular courses such as Business English, test preparation, learning about the country and culture, and much more. \r\n\r\n\u2605 Preply for tutors: As a tutor, you can manage your own schedule and send messages to your students. Full support is available on Preply.com.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for an app to learn a foreign language like Spanish, Korean, Italian, Arabic, Japanese, French or Russian language or to simply work on your accent in your personal English course, the Preply language learning app is the right choice!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Are you ready to take your language learning one step further? With Preply, you can learn Spanish, English, German, Dutch, French, Russian, Italian and many other languages at your own pace in one-on-one video lessons with your private tutor.</b><br><br>If you want to learn a foreign language or improve your pronunciation, this is the right place for you. Preply is a language learning app to find your expert language tutor. Now you can learn Spanish, English, Russian, German, Dutch, Thai, Arabic, Italian, Chinese, French and any other foreign language with native speakers and language experts. This app gives you access to personalized live lessons with your very own tutor, the vocabulary trainer and other learning materials.<br><br><b>Learn a new language: Find your tutor for one of 50+ languages, including</b><br><br>\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 English <br>\ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddf2\ud83c\uddfd Spanish<br>\ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea German<br>\ud83c\uddf3\ud83c\uddf1 Dutch<br>\ud83c\uddee\ud83c\uddf9 Italian<br>\ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7 French<br>\ud83c\udde8\ud83c\uddf3 Chinese (Mandarin, Cantonese)<br>\ud83c\uddef\ud83c\uddf5 Japanese<br>\ud83c\uddf7\ud83c\uddfa Russian<br>\ud83c\uddf9\ud83c\udded Thai<br>\u2026 and many more!<br>====================<br>\u2605 20% discount on the first lesson: Book your first foreign language learning lesson via the app with the <b>code APP20</b>!<br>====================<br><b>Learn a new language through private lessons</b><br><br>\u2605 Learning languages is easy and fun! More than 30.000 experienced language teachers are ready to practise with beginners (to learn a new language), intermediate and advanced learners. <br><br>\u2605 Tutors for over 50 languages, including: German, English, French, Italian, Polish, Chinese (Mandarin, Cantonese), Arabic, and many more.<br><br>\u2605 English course: Improve your skills with our vocabulary tool. With the vocabulary trainer, you can learn and consolidate vocabulary in the Preply English course.<br><br><b>With Preply, you can learn a foreign language wherever and whenever you want:</b><br><br>\u2605 Learn a new language at your pace and on your budget: English pronunciation training, Russian language or Chinese (Mandarin, Cantonese), English for kids, German spelling, improving the Mexican Spanish accent, or learn Spanish from scratch - whatever you want to improve!<br><br>\u2605 With Preply, international experts help you to learn a new language. Because it&#39;s so easy to find the right tutor from any part of the world, you can start at any time. The perfect English course and the perfect app to expand your German, Dutch or French vocabulary, and much more.<br><br>\u2605 To learn languages with our app is easy, especially when you learn with an expert tutor. To find your match, you can read student reviews, watch video presentations and view tutor profiles.<br><br>\u2605 With this language learning app, you can talk to a tutor via the integrated chat before booking your first lesson!<br><br>\u2605 Learn English vocabulary, learn to speak with an Mexican Spanish accent, improve your spelling in German, learn Spanish or start to learn Hindi or Thai - from anywhere via video call in the learning app itself or on the Preply website.<br><br>\u2605 Discuss your goals with your tutor: whether you want to learn languages from scratch, improve your grammar, become fluent in Arabic, Dutch, Korean, French, Turkish, Thai, Hindi, Japanese, Russian language, Chinese, etc., or improve your English pronunciation. If you wish, you can switch to a new teacher at any time, whom you can get to know through a course or live lessons.<br><br>\u2605 Preply is more than just a language learning app. You can supplement your lessons with interactive language games, materials and other activities, including popular courses such as Business English, test preparation, learning about the country and culture, and much more. <br><br>\u2605 Preply for tutors: As a tutor, you can manage your own schedule and send messages to your students. Full support is available on Preply.com.<br><br>Whether you are looking for an app to learn a foreign language like Spanish, Korean, Italian, Arabic, Japanese, French or Russian language or to simply work on your accent in your personal English course, the Preply language learning app is the right choice!",
